PROCESS='''<section class="rg-section rg-soft"><div class="rg-shell"><span class="rg-eyebrow">HydroSeal workflow</span><h2>Prep first. Then restore joints. Then seal.</h2><div class="rg-process"><article class="rg-card"><b>01</b><h3>Inspect</h3><p>Evaluate coating condition, staining, drainage, joints and surface use.</p></article><article class="rg-card"><b>02</b><h3>Deep clean</h3><p>Remove organic growth, dirt and problem buildup before fresh sealer is considered.</p></article><article class="rg-card"><b>03</b><h3>Restore joints</h3><p>Where needed, reset low joints with kiln-dried ASTM C144 joint sand.</p></article><article class="rg-card"><b>04</b><h3>Seal correctly</h3><p>Apply a compatible system only after the pavers are properly prepared and ready.</p></article></div><div class="rg-btns"><a class="rg-btn rg-btn--outline" href="/paver-cleaning">Paver Cleaning</a><a class="rg-btn rg-btn--outline" href="/paver-repair">Paver Repair</a><a class="rg-btn rg-btn--outline" href="/paver-resealing">Paver Resealing</a><a class="rg-btn rg-btn--outline" href="/paver-sealing/sand-options">Joint Sand Options</a></div></div></section>'''


